Next, I'll design the wiring for Step 4 in WorldManager.

Self position for terrain streaming:
- In-flight: the pose of the predicted ship is written by setSelfShipTransform (60 Hz) — it's also possible to track that in a `selfTransformPos` field. setShipPos (10 Hz) sets selfPos.
- On foot: setCharacterPos/setCharacterTransform sets the character's pos.

The spec says "self position (the predicted ship pose while flying, the character position on foot — whatever setShipPos / the character feed already provides)." The simplest approach is: track a `terrainFeedPos` updated at:
- setSelfShipTransform (60 Hz prediction)
- setShipPos (10 Hz snapshot)
- applyCharacterTransform (the character's pos)

In practice: maintain `selfPos` (existing, via setShipPos) and a new `lastFeedPos: Vec3 | null` updated by setSelfShipTransform and applyCharacterTransform. Then terrain pos = lastFeedPos ?? selfPos.

Speed: derive it from the delta of feed pos / dt in the frame loop. Maintain prevTerrainPos + prevTerrainMs.

Frame loop (after frameHook, before render):
```ts
this.updatePlanetTerrain(dtSec);
```

```ts
private terrainStreamer: ChunkStreamer | null = null;
private terrainScene: ChunkScene | null = null;
private terrainPlanetId: string | null = null;
private terrainFeedPos: Vec3 | null = null;
private lastTerrainPos: Vec3 | null = null;

private updatePlanetTerrain(dtSec: number): void {
  const pos = this.terrainFeedPos ?? this.selfPos;
  if (!pos || !this.system || !this.worldGroup) { return; }
  // speed from feed delta (u/s)
  let speed = 0;
  if (this.lastTerrainPos && dtSec > 0) {
    speed = Math.hypot(pos.x - this.lastTerrainPos.x, pos.y - this.lastTerrainPos.y, pos.z - this.lastTerrainPos.z) / dtSec;
  }
  this.lastTerrainPos = pos;
  const target = terrainPlanetFor(pos, this.system, this.terrainPlanetId);
  if (target !== this.terrainPlanetId) this.mountPlanetTerrain(target);
  if (this.terrainStreamer && this.terrainScene) {
    // WORLD coordinates — the same frame the server samples terrain in
    this.terrainStreamer.update(pos.x, pos.z, speed);
    this.terrainScene.sync(pos.x, pos.z, speed);
  }
}

private mountPlanetTerrain(planetId: string | null): void {
  // tear down
  if (this.terrainScene) { this.worldGroup?.remove(this.terrainScene.group); this.terrainScene.dispose(); this.terrainScene = null; }
  this.terrainStreamer?.reset();
  this.terrainStreamer = null;
  this.terrainPlanetId = planetId;
  if (!planetId || !this.system || !this.worldGroup) return;
  const index = this.system.planets.findIndex((p) => p.id === planetId);
  if (index < 0) return;
  const planet = this.system.planets[index];
  const anchor = planetAnchor(index);
  const pad = this.pads.find((p) => p.planetId === planetId);
  this.terrainStreamer = new ChunkStreamer(this.seed, planet, {
    pad: pad ?? undefined,
    chunkFilter: (cx, cz) => chunkInSurface(cx, cz, anchor),
  });
  this.terrainScene = new ChunkScene(this.terrainStreamer);
  this.worldGroup.add(this.terrainScene.group);
}
```

